r download is now in progress and you may close this window\\nDid you know that with a free Taylor & Francis Online account you can gain access to the following benefits?\\n  * Choose new content alerts to be informed about new research of interest to you\\n  * Easy remote access to your institution's subscriptions on any device, from any location\\n  * Save your searches and schedule alerts to send you new results\\n  * Export your search results into a .csv file to support your research\\n\\n\\nHave an account? [Login now](https://www.tandfonline.com/action/showLogin?uri=) Don't have an account? [Register for free](https://www.tandfonline.com/action/registration?redirectUri=)\\n## Login or register to access this feature\\nHave an account? [Login now](https://www.tandfonline.com/action/showLogin?uri=) Don't have an account? [Register for free](https://www.tandfonline.com/action/registration?redirectUri=)\\nRegister a free Taylor & Francis Online account today to boost your research and gain these benefits:\\n  * Choose new content alerts to be informed about new research of interest to you\\n  * Easy remote access to your institution's subscriptions on any device, from any location\\n  * Save your searches and schedule alerts to send you new results\\n  * Export your search results into a .csv file to support your research\\n\\n\\n[Register](https://www.tandfonline.com/action/registration?redirectUri=) now or [learn more](https://help.tandfonline.com/s/article/benefits-of-registering)\\nSearch in: This Journal  Anywhere \\n[Advanced search](https://www.tandfonline.com/search/advanced)\\n![Publication Cover](https://www.tandfonline.com/action/showCoverImage?doi=10.1080/tprs20.v059.i19)\\n[ International Journal of Production Research ](https://www.tandfonline.com/journals/tprs20) Volume 59, 2021 - [Issue 19](https://www.tandfonline.com/toc/tprs20/59/19)\\n[Submit an article](https://rp.tandfonline.com/submission/create?journalCode=TPRS) [Journal homepage](https://www.tandfonline.com/tprs20)\\n4,200 \\nViews \\n106 \\nCrossRef citations to date \\n0\\nAltmetric \\nArticles\\n# The architectural framework of a cyber physical logistics system for digital-twin-based supply chain control\\n[Kyu Tae Park](https://www.tandfonline.com/author/Park%2C+Kyu+Tae)a Department of Industrial Engineering, Sungkyunkwan University, Suwon-si, Republic of Korea;b Digital Factory Solution R&D Center, MICUBE Solution Inc., Seoul, Republic of Korea[View further author information](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738#Funding)\\n, \\n[Yoo Ho Son](https://www.tandfonline.com/author/Son%2C+Yoo+Ho)a Department of Industrial Engineering, Sungkyunkwan University, Suwon-si, Republic of Korea[View further author information](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738#Funding)\\n&\\n[Sang Do Noh](https://www.tandfonline.com/author/Noh%2C+Sang+Do)a Department of Industrial Engineering, Sungkyunkwan University, Suwon-si, Republic of KoreaCorrespondencesdnoh@skku.edu[View further author information](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738#Funding)\\nPages 5721-5742 | Received 25 Feb 2020, Accepted 22 Jun 2020, Published online: 06 Jul 2020\\n  * [ Cite this article ](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738 \\\"Cite this article\\\")\\n  * <https://doi.org/10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738>\\n  * [ ![CrossMark Logo](https://www.tandfonline.com/templates/jsp/images/CROSSMARK_Color_horizontal.svg) CrossMark ](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738)\\n\\n\\n[![Sample our Economics, Finance,Business & Industry journals, sign in here to start your access, latest two full volumes FREE to you for 14 days](https://:0) ](https://www.tandfonline.com/action/clickThrough?id=5931&url=%2Fr%2Fsubjectsample-efbi&loc=%2Fdoi%2Fabs%2F10.1080%2F00207543.2020.1788738&pubId=54937859&placeholderId=1074&productId=3092)\\n  * [ Full Article ](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738?scroll=top&needAccess=true)\\n  * [ Figures & data ](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/figure/10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738?scroll=top&needAccess=true)\\n  * [ References ](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/ref/10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738?scroll=top)\\n  * [ Citations ](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/citedby/10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738?scroll=top&needAccess=true)\\n  * [ Metrics ](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/metrics/10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738?scroll=top)\\n  * [ Reprints & Permissions ](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/permissions/10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738?scroll=top)\\n  * [ Read this article  /doi/full/10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738?needAccess=true  ](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738)\\n\\n\\n## Abstract\\nPersonalised production allows the supply chain (SC) to exist in various dynamic fluctuations within a make-to-order (MTO) environment. An SC for personalised production has redundant inventory and operation capacity; therefore, it requires a system that can achieve recoverability for operation resilience. Thus, a standalone cyber physical system (CPS) has limitation for SC control with MTO. To solve this problem, the CPS must be coordinated, and a systematic approach is required. This study proposes a cyber physical logistics system (CPLS) that is coordinated with the agent cyber physical production systems in a multi-level CPS structure. This multi-level architectural framework is designed to provide technical functionalities for resilient SC control. The service composition procedures of technical functionalities on the distributed digital twin (DT) simulation are divided into type and instance stages. The operation procedures of the DT application and technical functionality of the DT engine are suggested. The proposed CPLS has appropriate service composition and operation for the bullwhip and ripple effects, which are the two main SC-related problems. This study illustrates an early case of CPLS that can minimise differences among assets using distributed DT simulation; furthermore, the study establishes an SC and production plan based on the DT simulation results.\\nKEYWORDS: \\n  * [Asset administration shell](https://www.tandfonline.com/keyword/Asset+administration+shell)\\n  * [cyber physical system](https://www.tandfonline.com/keyword/cyber+physical+system)\\n  * [digital twin](https://www.tandfonline.com/keyword/digital+twin)\\n  * [distributed simulation](https://www.tandfonline.com/keyword/distributed+simulation)\\n  * [mass customisation](https://www.tandfonline.com/keyword/mass+customisation)\\n  * [supply chain control](https://www.tandfonline.com/keyword/supply+chain+control)\\n\\n\\n### Acknowledgement\\nThis work was funded by the KIAT and MOTIE (P0009839, Cyber Physical Assembly and Logistics System for in Global Supply Chain), and the WC300 Project funded by the Ministry of SMEs and Startups (S2482274, Development of Multi-vehicle Flexible Manufacturing Platform Technology for Future Smart Automotive Body Production).\\n## Disclosure statement\\nNo potential conflict of interest was reported by the author(s).\\n## Additional information\\n### Funding\\nThis work was funded by the KIAT and MOTIE ([grant number P0009839], Cyber Physical Assembly and Logistics System for in Global Supply Chain), and the WC300 Project funded by the Ministry of SMEs and Startups ([grant number S2482274], Development of Multi-vehicle Flexible Manufacturing Platform Technology for Future Smart Automotive Body Production).\\n### Reprints and Corporate Permissions\\nPlease note: Selecting permissions **does not** provide access to the full text of the article, please see our help page [How do I view content?](https://help.tandfonline.com/s/article/How-do-I-view-content)\\nTo request a reprint or corporate permissions for this article, please click on the relevant link below:\\n[ Order Reprints ](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738) [ Request Corporate Permissions ](https://www.tandfonline.com/action/requestPermissions?doi=10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738)\\n### Academic Permissions\\nPlease note: Selecting permissions **does not** provide access to the full text of the article, please see our help page [How do I view content?](https://help.tandfonline.com/s/article/How-do-I-view-content)\\nObtain permissions instantly via Rightslink by clicking on the button below:\\n[Request Academic Permissions](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738)\\nIf you are unable to obtain permissions via Rightslink, please complete and submit this [Permissions form](https://www.tandfonline.com/action/requestPermissions?doi=10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738). For more information, please visit our [Permissions help page](https://www.tandfonline.com/page/help/permissions).\\n  * [ Share ](https://www.addtoany.com/share)\\n  * [ Back to Top ](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738#top)\\n\\n\\n## Related research \\n**People also read** lists articles that other readers of this article have read.\\n**Recommended articles** lists articles that we recommend and is powered by our AI driven recommendation engine.\\n**Cited by** lists all citing articles based on Crossref citations.Articles with the Crossref icon will open in a new tab.\\n  * [People also read](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738#2b85d6ca-6520-4a3d-8e4a-aa9f2ee3f33d-58132d06-cf2f-4e31-a696-f4f2aa0cdd9a \\\"show People also read\\\")\\n  * [Recommended articles](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738#2b85d6ca-6520-4a3d-8e4a-aa9f2ee3f33d-b6de7b7c-de82-45a5-9538-313dd15c6659 \\\"show Recommended articles\\\")\\n  * [Cited by](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738#2b85d6ca-6520-4a3d-8e4a-aa9f2ee3f33d-357c6cfb-53ba-4fa0-8e6b-e69fc2b8ce9f \\\"show Cited by\\\")\\n\\n\\n## To cite this article:\\nReference styl