  "output": "根据搜索结果，我已经找到了以下与cyber-physical Internet在物流领域应用相关的高质量论文：\n\n1. \"The architectural framework of a cyber physical logistics system for digital-twin-based supply chain control\" by Kyu Tae Park, Yoo Ho Son, and Sang Do Noh (2021)\nDOI: https://doi.org/10.1080/00207543.2020.1788738\n这篇论文提出了一个网络物理物流系统(CPLS)框架，用于数字孪生技术在供应链控制中的应用。\n\n2. \"Cyber Physical Integrated Digital Twin Network Model for Enterprise Producing High-Performing Logistics\" (Wireless Personal Communications, 2024)\n这篇论文研究了数字孪生网络模型在高性能物流企业中的应用，包括路由优化和跟踪能力。\n\n3. \"Digital twin—Cyber replica of physical things: Architecture, applications and future research directions\" (Future Internet, 2022)\n这篇论文探讨了数字孪生作为物理事物的网络复制品的架构、应用和未来研究方向。\n\n4. \"Artificial intelligence in smart logistics cyber-physical systems: State-of-the-arts and potential applications\" (2023)\n这篇论文讨论了人工智能在智能物流网络物理系统中的应用状态和潜在应用。\n\n5. \"The architecture of an intelligent digital twin for a cyber-physical route-finding system in smart cities\" (2020)\n这篇论文描述了智能数字孪生在智能城市网络物理路径查找系统中的架构。\n\n6. \"Digital twin-driven production logistics synchronization system for vehicle routing problems with pick-up and delivery in industrial park\" (2021)\n这篇论文研究了数字孪生驱动的生产物流同步系统在工业园区车辆路径问题中的应用。\n\n7. \"From traditional warehouses to Physical Internet hubs: A digital twin-based inbound synchronization framework for PI-order management\" (2022)\n这篇论文提出了一个从传统仓库到物理互联网枢纽的基于数字孪生的入站同步框架。\n\n8. \"Digital twin integrated reinforced learning in supply chain and logistics\" (2021)\n这篇论文研究了数字孪生集成强化学习在供应链和物流中的应用。\n\n9. \"The physical internet in the era of digital transformation: perspectives and open issues\" (2021)\n这篇论文探讨了数字转型时代的物理互联网的前景和开放问题。\n\n这些论文涵盖了物流系统中的路由优化方法、物联网技术在物流跟踪与监控中的应用、数字孪生技术在物流系统中的实现以及智能物流系统的架构设计等方面。",
