rotocols+for+B2B+e-commerce+logistics+in+cyber-physical+internet\\\\(CPI\\\\)&scisbd=1)\\n\\n\\n  * [不限語言](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?lr=&q=Routing+protocols+for+B2B+e-commerce+logistics+in+cyber-physical+internet\\\\(CPI\\\\)&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2019&as_yhi=2024)\\n  * [搜尋所有中文網頁](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?lr=lang_zh-CN|lang_zh-TW&q=Routing+protocols+for+B2B+e-commerce+logistics+in+cyber-physical+internet\\\\(CPI\\\\)&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2019&as_yhi=2024)\\n  * [搜尋繁體中文網頁](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?lr=lang_zh-TW&q=Routing+protocols+for+B2B+e-commerce+logistics+in+cyber-physical+internet\\\\(CPI\\\\)&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2019&as_yhi=2024)\\n\\n\\n  * [不限類型](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=Routing+protocols+for+B2B+e-commerce+logistics+in+cyber-physical+internet\\\\(CPI\\\\)&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2019&as_yhi=2024)\\n  * [評論性文章](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=Routing+protocols+for+B2B+e-commerce+logistics+in+cyber-physical+internet\\\\(CPI\\\\)&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2019&as_yhi=2024&as_rr=1)\\n\\n\\n  * [包含專利](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?as_sdt=2007&q=Routing+protocols+for+B2B+e-commerce+logistics+in+cyber-physical+internet\\\\(CPI\\\\)&hl=zh-TW&as_ylo=2019&as_yhi=2024)\\n  * [只包含書目/引用資料](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?as_vis=1&q=Routing+protocols+for+B2B+e-commerce+logistics+in+cyber-physical+internet\\\\(CPI\\\\)&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2019&as_yhi=2024)\\n\\n\\n2019 - 2024\\n### [Routing protocols for B2B e-commerce logistics in cyber-physical internet (CPI)](https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0360835224004145)\\n[X Qu](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=OFfv_0IAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [M Li](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=JuAPUpsAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [Z Ouyang](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=_X9U8T4AAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), C Ng, [GQ Huang](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=zp9GA7EAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra) - Computers & Industrial …, 2024 - Elsevier\\n[X Qu](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=OFfv_0IAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [M Li](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=JuAPUpsAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [Z Ouyang](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=_X9U8T4AAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), C Ng, [GQ Huang](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=zp9GA7EAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra)\\nComputers & Industrial Engineering, 2024•Elsevier\\nCurrently, the boom in B2B e-commerce logistics and the fragmentation of logistics networks have put tremendous pressure on the efficient and economical routing of packages. The idea of the cyber-physical internet (CPI) in logistics is to establish a new paradigm for sending and receiving goods, similar to how sending and receiving instant messages over the internet might be a solution. This work focuses on the routing process in B2B e-commerce logistics driven by the CPI. A framework of B2B e-commerce logistics in CPI …\\nAbstract\\nCurrently, the boom in B2B e-commerce logistics and the fragmentation of logistics networks have put tremendous pressure on the efficient and economical routing of packages. The idea of the cyber-physical internet (CPI) in logistics is to establish a new paradigm for sending and receiving goods, similar to how sending and receiving instant messages over the internet might be a solution. This work focuses on the routing process in B2B e-commerce logistics driven by the CPI. A framework of B2B e-commerce logistics in CPI networks is proposed to integrate logistics networks with components such as CPI routers, routing tables, and autonomous logistics systems (ALSs). Routing protocols within and among ALSs are proposed for making routing decisions based on information in routing tables for efficient and economical routing. Finally, two B2B e-commerce logistics scenarios are utilized to simulate the routing protocols in CPI networks to prove their feasibility, and their sensitivity is analysed. This work may support the improvement of B2B e-commerce logistics networks and intelligent logistics in Industry 4.0.\\nElsevier\\n[顯示更多顯示較少](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\))\\n[儲存](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\)) [引用](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\)) [被引用 10 次](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?cites=3002796283784810905&as_sdt=2005&sciodt=0,5&hl=zh-TW) [相關文章](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=related:mVHbg08TrCkJ:scholar.google.com/&scioq=Routing+protocols+for+B2B+e-commerce+logistics+in+cyber-physical+internet\\\\(CPI\\\\)&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2019&as_yhi=2024) [全部共 3 個版本](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?cluster=3002796283784810905&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2019&as_yhi=2024) [](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\) \\\"顯示更多服務\\\") [](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\) \\\"顯示較少服務\\\")\\n顯示最佳搜尋結果。 [查看所有結果](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?lookup=0&q=Routing+protocols+for+B2B+e-commerce+logistics+in+cyber-physical+internet\\\\(CPI\\\\)&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2019&as_yhi=2024)\\n[隱私權](https://www.google.com/intl/zh-TW/policies/privacy/)[服務條款](https://www.google.com/intl/zh-TW/policies/terms/)[說明](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\))\\n[關於學術搜尋](https://scholar.google.com/intl/zh-TW/scholar/about.html)[Google 搜尋說明](https://support.google.com/websearch?p=scholar_dsa&hl=zh-TW)\\n\",\n  \"total_lines\": 86,\n  \"line_range\": \"1-86\",\n  \"file_path\": \"upload/scholar_results/Routing_protocols_for_B2B_e_commerce_logistics_in_cyber_physical_internetCPI_2019-2024.md\",\n  \"container_path\": \"/workspace/tasks/agent_test/upload/scholar_results/Routing_protocols_for_B2B_e_commerce_logistics_in_cyber_physical_internetCPI_2019-2024.md\"\n}",
