4 - 2024\\n### [Cyber-physical internet based intelligent operation platform for off-site construction supply chain management](https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/17517575.2024.2346743)\\n[L Yin](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=HGAwu_gAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), T Li, G Li, [S Besklubova](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=fe9lg04AAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [RY Zhong](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=KfDl2DIAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra)… - Enterprise Information …, 2024 - Taylor & Francis\\n[L Yin](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=HGAwu_gAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), T Li, G Li, [S Besklubova](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=fe9lg04AAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [RY Zhong](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=KfDl2DIAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [S Zhao](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=oPrJ4FIAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra)\\nEnterprise Information Systems, 2024•Taylor & Francis\\nOff-site construction (OSC) projects rely on a smooth off-site supply chain. Previous studies improved supply chain management (SCM), while scantly mentioning business flow and recent advanced technology. This paper proposes a three-layered cyber-physical internet (CPI)-based platform for practical OSC-SCM. The scalable layer connects resources via an industrial driver (ID) for an information chain. The kernel layer designs protocols for digital twins (DT) and twin networks with incentive and information sharing mechanisms. The …\\nAbstract\\nOff-site construction (OSC) projects rely on a smooth off-site supply chain. Previous studies improved supply chain management (SCM), while scantly mentioning business flow and recent advanced technology. This paper proposes a three-layered cyber-physical internet (CPI)-based platform for practical OSC-SCM. The scalable layer connects resources via an industrial driver (ID) for an information chain. The kernel layer designs protocols for digital twins (DT) and twin networks with incentive and information sharing mechanisms. The application layer offers thirteen services for offsite plant, logistics, and on-site assembly. A case study demonstrates 20% reduced construction time and millions of cost savings, proving enhanced efficiency.\\nTaylor & Francis Online\\n[顯示更多顯示較少](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\))\\n[儲存](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\)) [引用](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\)) [被引用 6 次](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?cites=10915641959109987442&as_sdt=2005&sciodt=0,5&hl=zh-TW) [相關文章](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=related:cowZPIcmfJcJ:scholar.google.com/&scioq=Cyber-physical+internet+based+intelligent+operation+platform+for+off-site+construction+supply+chain+management+Yin+et+al.+2024+Enterprise+Information+Systems&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2024&as_yhi=2024) [全部共 4 個版本](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?cluster=10915641959109987442&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2024&as_yhi=2024) [](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\) \\\"顯示更多服務\\\") [](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\) \\\"顯示較少服務\\\")\\n顯示最佳搜尋結果。 [查看所有結果](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?lookup=0&q=Cyber-physical+internet+based+intelligent+operation+platform+for+off-site+construction+supply+chain+management+Yin+et+al.+2024+Enterprise+Information+Systems&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2024&as_yhi=2024)\\n[隱私權](https://www.google.com/intl/zh-TW/policies/privacy/)[服務條款](https://www.google.com/intl/zh-TW/policies/terms/)[說明](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\))\\n[關於學術搜尋](https://scholar.google.com/intl/zh-TW/scholar/about.html)[Google 搜尋說明](https://support.google.com/websearch?p=scholar_dsa&hl=zh-TW)\\n\",\n  \"total_lines\": 86,\n  \"line_range\": \"1-86\",\n  \"file_path\": \"upload/scholar_results/Cyber_physical_internet_based_intelligent_operation_platform_for_off_site_construction_supply_chain_management_Yin_et_al_2024_Enterprise_Information_Systems_2024-2024.md\",\n  \"container_path\": \"/workspace/tasks/agent_test/upload/scholar_results/Cyber_physical_internet_based_intelligent_operation_platform_for_off_site_construction_supply_chain_management_Yin_et_al_2024_