l.+2025&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2025&as_yhi=2025&as_rr=1)\\n\\n\\n  * [包含專利](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?as_sdt=2007&q=%22Operations+with+physical+internet%22+Pan+et+al.+2025&hl=zh-TW&as_ylo=2025&as_yhi=2025)\\n  * [只包含書目/引用資料](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?as_vis=1&q=%22Operations+with+physical+internet%22+Pan+et+al.+2025&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2025&as_yhi=2025)\\n\\n\\n2025 - 2025\\n[[PDF] hal.science](https://hal.science/hal-05100066/document)\\n### [**Operations with physical internet**](https://hal.science/hal-05100066/)\\n[S **Pan**](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=DkCjC8kAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [E Ballot](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=lICLCJ8AAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [GQ Huang](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=zp9GA7EAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra) - Reference Module in Social Sciences, **2025** - hal.science\\n[S **Pan**](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=DkCjC8kAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [E Ballot](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=lICLCJ8AAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [GQ Huang](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=zp9GA7EAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra)\\nReference Module in Social Sciences, **2025** •hal.science\\nPhysical Internet (PI) is an revolutionary and rapidly advancing paradigm in the field of global logistics and supply chain management. Initially, PI was conceptualised as a framework that emulates the data packet transmission model of the digital internet, applying it to freight transport and logistics over the physical systems. Over time, the PI concept has significantly evolved, incorporating cutting-edge technologies such as the Internet of Things (IoT), Digital Twins, and Artificial Intelligence, and aligning with emerging economic models …\\nPhysical Internet (PI) is an revolutionary and rapidly advancing paradigm in the field of global logistics and supply chain management. Initially, PI was conceptualised as a framework that emulates the data packet transmission model of the digital internet, applying it to freight transport and logistics over the physical systems. Over time, the PI concept has significantly evolved, incorporating cutting-edge technologies such as the Internet of Things (IoT), Digital Twins, and Artificial Intelligence, and aligning with emerging economic models like platform economy, sharing economy, or circular economy, for example. As a result, PI has developed into a holistic paradigm aimed at streamlining and optimising logistics operations and supply chain management to enhance the sustainability and resilience. This chapter explores the potential of PI to transform operations management within logistics and supply chains, highlighting key pathways for its continued evolution and impact. Additionally, it outlines promising research avenues, where PI and emerging operations management practices can complement each other, notably in logistics coopetition, Cyber-Physical Internet, and Logistics-as-a-Service models.\\nhal.science\\n[顯示更多顯示較少](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\))\\n[儲存](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\)) [引用](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\)) [被引用 1 次](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?cites=4940771073652873401&as_sdt=2005&sciodt=0,5&hl=zh-TW) [相關文章](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=related:udiaOR0lkUQJ:scholar.google.com/&scioq=%22Operations+with+physical+internet%22+Pan+et+al.+2025&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2025&as_yhi=2025) [全部共 4 個版本](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?cluster=4940771073652873401&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2025&as_yhi=2025) [](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\) \\\"顯示更多服務\\\") [HTML 版](https://scholar.googleusercontent.com/scholar?q=cache:udiaOR0lkUQJ:scholar.google.com/+%22Operations+with+physical+internet%22+Pan+et+al.+2025&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2025&as_yhi=2025) [](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\) \\\"顯示較少服務\\\")\\n顯示最佳搜尋結果。 [查看所有結果](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?lookup=0&q=%22Operations+with+physical+internet%22+Pan+et+al.+2025&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2025&as_yhi=2025)\\n[隱私權](https://www.google.com/intl/zh-TW/polic