ystems%22+Li+et+al.+2025&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2025&as_yhi=2025)\\n  * [搜尋所有中文網頁](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?lr=lang_zh-CN|lang_zh-TW&q=%22Out-of-Order+Architecture+for+Real-Time+Data-Driven+Resilient+Planning+and+Scheduling+of+Cyber-Physical+Manufacturing+Systems%22+Li+et+al.+2025&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2025&as_yhi=2025)\\n  * [搜尋繁體中文網頁](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?lr=lang_zh-TW&q=%22Out-of-Order+Architecture+for+Real-Time+Data-Driven+Resilient+Planning+and+Scheduling+of+Cyber-Physical+Manufacturing+Systems%22+Li+et+al.+2025&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2025&as_yhi=2025)\\n\\n\\n  * [不限類型](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=%22Out-of-Order+Architecture+for+Real-Time+Data-Driven+Resilient+Planning+and+Scheduling+of+Cyber-Physical+Manufacturing+Systems%22+Li+et+al.+2025&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2025&as_yhi=2025)\\n  * [評論性文章](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=%22Out-of-Order+Architecture+for+Real-Time+Data-Driven+Resilient+Planning+and+Scheduling+of+Cyber-Physical+Manufacturing+Systems%22+Li+et+al.+2025&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2025&as_yhi=2025&as_rr=1)\\n\\n\\n  * [包含專利](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?as_sdt=2007&q=%22Out-of-Order+Architecture+for+Real-Time+Data-Driven+Resilient+Planning+and+Scheduling+of+Cyber-Physical+Manufacturing+Systems%22+Li+et+al.+2025&hl=zh-TW&as_ylo=2025&as_yhi=2025)\\n  * [只包含書目/引用資料](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?as_vis=1&q=%22Out-of-Order+Architecture+for+Real-Time+Data-Driven+Resilient+Planning+and+Scheduling+of+Cyber-Physical+Manufacturing+Systems%22+Li+et+al.+2025&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2025&as_yhi=2025)\\n\\n\\n2025 - 2025\\n### [Out-of-Order Architecture for Real-Time Data-Driven Resilient Planning and Scheduling of Cyber-Physical Manufacturing Systems](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/10972083/)\\n[M Li](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=ZWpXsKwAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), T Qu, B Liu, Q Luo, M Yan, [M Li](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=JuAPUpsAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra)… - IEEE Transactions …, 2025 - ieeexplore.ieee.org\\n[M Li](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=ZWpXsKwAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), T Qu, B Liu, Q Luo, M Yan, [M Li](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=JuAPUpsAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), Z He, [GQ Huang](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=zp9GA7EAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra)\\nIEEE Transactions on Automation Science and Engineering, 2025•ieeexplore.ieee.org\\nThe intrinsic stochasticity of manufacturing is one of the main factors that hinder system resilience. Planning and scheduling problems are typical examples plagued by uncertainties such as stochastic processing time, arrivals of new orders, and breakdowns of workstations. Frequent uncertainties disturb the workflow, and their cascading effects create chaos in the whole system. The transparency and traceability analytics in Cyber-Physical Manufacturing Systems (CPMS) bring new hope to tackle uncertainties. Inspired by the core …\\nThe intrinsic stochasticity of manufacturing is one of the main factors that hinder system resilience. Planning and scheduling problems are typical examples plagued by uncertainties such as stochastic processing time, arrivals of new orders, and breakdowns of workstations. Frequent uncertainties disturb the workflow, and their cascading effects create chaos in the whole system. The transparency and traceability analytics in Cyber-Physical Manufacturing Systems (CPMS) bring new hope to tackle uncertainties. Inspired by the core spirit of Out-of-Order (OoO) Execution in CPU, this paper proposes a novel OoO architecture for resilient planning and scheduling in CPMS with real-time data analytics. Following OoO principles, multi-level instruction queues are constructed, under which manufacturing operations (instructions) are sequenced and performed by analyzing real-time dependencies and executability. This study contributes a new perspective to enhance decision resilience using real-time data in CPMS. Results validate the effectiveness and resilience of OoO under different levels of uncertainty, showing improvements in the on-time delivery rate and reductions in the average order flow time.\\nieeexplore.ieee.org\\n[顯示更多顯示較少](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\))\\n[儲存](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\)) [引用](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\)) [被引用 1 次](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?cites=12707560590144818223&as_sdt=2005&sciodt=0,5&hl=zh-TW) [相關文章](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=related:L8xVeQdTWrAJ:scholar.google.com/&scioq=%22Out-of-Order+Architecture+for+Real-Time+Data-Driven+Resilient+Planning+and+Scheduling+of+Cyber-Physical+Manufacturing+Systems%22+Li+et+al.+2025&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2025&as_yhi=2025) [全部共 4 個版本](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?cluster=12707560590144818223&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2025&as_yhi=2025) [](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\) \\\"顯示更多服務\\\") [](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\) \\\"顯示較少服務\\\")\\n顯示最佳搜尋結果。 [查看所有結果](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?lookup=0&q=%22Out-of-Order+Architecture+for+Real-Time+Data-Driven+Resilient+Planning+and+Scheduling+of+Cyber-Physical+Manufacturing+Systems%22+Li+et+al.+2025&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_ylo=2025&as_yhi=2025)\\n[隱私權](https://www.google.com/intl/zh-TW/policies/privacy/)[服務條款](https://www.google.com/intl/zh-TW/policies/terms/)[說明](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\))\\n[關於學術搜尋](https://scholar.google.com/intl/zh-TW/scholar/about.html)[Google 搜尋說明](https://support.google.com/websearch?p=scholar_dsa&hl=zh-TW)\\n\",\n  \"total_lines\": 85,\n  \"line_range\": \"1-85\",\n  \"file_path\": \"upload/scholar_results/Out_of_Order_Architecture_for_Real_Time_Data_Driven_Resilient_Planning_and_Scheduling_of_Cyber_Physical_Manufacturing_Systems_Li_et_al_2025_2025-2025.md\",\n  \"container_path\": \"/workspace/tasks/agent_test/upload/scholar_results/Out_of_Order_Architecture_for_Real_Time_Data_Driven_Resilient_Planning_and_Scheduling_of_Cyber_Physical_Manufacturing_Systems_Li_et_al_2025_2025-2025.md\"\n}",
