reation,+Configuration,+Execution%22+Lei+et+al.&scisbd=1)\\n\\n\\n  * [不限語言](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?lr=&q=%22Cyber-Physical+Internet+Asset+Services+and+Hosts:+Creation,+Configuration,+Execution%22+Lei+et+al.&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5)\\n  * [搜尋所有中文網頁](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?lr=lang_zh-CN|lang_zh-TW&q=%22Cyber-Physical+Internet+Asset+Services+and+Hosts:+Creation,+Configuration,+Execution%22+Lei+et+al.&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5)\\n  * [搜尋繁體中文網頁](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?lr=lang_zh-TW&q=%22Cyber-Physical+Internet+Asset+Services+and+Hosts:+Creation,+Configuration,+Execution%22+Lei+et+al.&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5)\\n\\n\\n  * [不限類型](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=%22Cyber-Physical+Internet+Asset+Services+and+Hosts:+Creation,+Configuration,+Execution%22+Lei+et+al.&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5)\\n  * [評論性文章](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=%22Cyber-Physical+Internet+Asset+Services+and+Hosts:+Creation,+Configuration,+Execution%22+Lei+et+al.&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5&as_rr=1)\\n\\n\\n  * [包含專利](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?as_sdt=2007&q=%22Cyber-Physical+Internet+Asset+Services+and+Hosts:+Creation,+Configuration,+Execution%22+Lei+et+al.&hl=zh-TW)\\n  * [只包含書目/引用資料](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?as_vis=1&q=%22Cyber-Physical+Internet+Asset+Services+and+Hosts:+Creation,+Configuration,+Execution%22+Lei+et+al.&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5)\\n\\n\\n[建立快訊](https://scholar.google.com/scholar_alerts?view_op=create_alert_options&hl=zh-TW&alert_query=%22Cyber-Physical+Internet+Asset+Services+and+Hosts:+Creation,+Configuration,+Execution%22+Lei+et+al.&alert_params=%3Fhl%3Dzh-TW%26as_sdt%3D0,5)\\n[[PDF] ssrn.com](https://papers.ssrn.com/sol3/Delivery.cfm?abstractid=5180628)\\n### [Cyber-Physical Internet Asset Services and Hosts: Creation, Configuration, Execution](https://papers.ssrn.com/sol3/papers.cfm?abstract_id=5180628)\\nW Lei, [C Yu](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=gOet-i8AAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), M Li, [YH Kuo](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=9-ikdFAAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [GQ Huang](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=zp9GA7EAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra) - Configuration, Execution - papers.ssrn.com\\nW Lei, [C Yu](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=gOet-i8AAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), M Li, [YH Kuo](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=9-ikdFAAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra), [GQ Huang](https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=zp9GA7EAAAAJ&hl=zh-TW&oi=sra)\\nConfiguration, Execution•papers.ssrn.com\\nAbstract The Cyber-Physical Internet (CPI) framework presents the CPI Truck asset host entity as a model for creating, configuring, and executing asset services and hosts. This innovative example enhances the management of physical and network assets in logistics, improving execution efficiency under dynamic conditions. This study offers three key contributions: First, it establishes a comprehensive architecture for CPI asset services and hosts, with the truck positioned as a sustainable asset host and providing a reconfigurable …\\nAbstract\\nThe Cyber-Physical Internet (CPI) framework presents the CPI Truck asset host entity as a model for creating, configuring, and executing asset services and hosts. This innovative example enhances the management of physical and network assets in logistics, improving execution efficiency under dynamic conditions. This study offers three key contributions: First, it establishes a comprehensive architecture for CPI asset services and hosts, with the truck positioned as a sustainable asset host and providing a reconfigurable solution for dynamic data processes. Second, a printer-like approach to asset management is employed, simplifying the creation and configuration of CPI asset services and hosts, thus increasing operational flexibility and adaptability. Third, we develop an execution solution for the CPI Truck, ensuring synchronized management and execution of network and physical assets. The study also acknowledges limitations, such as the focus on basic device integration and data collection, the lack of real-world validation, and unaddressed security concerns in data handling. Future research directions involve integrating IoT and AI for enhanced data processing, developing scalable and interoperable solutions for logistics scenarios, and implementing robust security measures to safeguard data within the CPI network.\\npapers.ssrn.com\\n[顯示更多顯示較少](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\))\\n[儲存](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\)) [引用](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\)) [相關文章](https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=related:TOFckji4veIJ:scholar.google.com/&scioq=%22Cyber-Physical+Internet+Asset+Services+and+Hosts:+Creation,+Configuration,+Execution%22+Lei+et+al.&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5) [](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\) \\\"顯示更多服務\\\") [HTML 版](https://scholar.googleusercontent.com/scholar?q=cache:TOFckji4veIJ:scholar.google.com/+%22Cyber-Physical+Internet+Asset+Services+and+Hosts:+Creation,+Configuration,+Execution%22+Lei+et+al.&hl=zh-TW&as_sdt=0,5) [](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\) \\\"顯示較少服務\\\")\\n[建立快訊](https://scholar.google.com/scholar_alerts?view_op=create_alert_options&hl=zh-TW&alert_query=%22Cyber-Physical+Internet+Asset+Services+and+Hosts:+Creation,+Configuration,+Execution%22+Lei+et+al.&alert_params=%3Fhl%3Dzh-TW%26as_sdt%3D0,5)\\n[隱私權](https://www.google.com/intl/zh-TW/policies/privacy/)[服務條款](https://www.google.com/intl/zh-TW/policies/terms/)[說明](javascript:void\\\\(0\\\\))\\n[關於學術搜尋](https://scholar.google.com/intl/zh-TW/scholar/about.html)[Google 搜尋說明](https://support.google.com/websearch?p=scholar_dsa&hl=zh-TW)\\n\",\n  \"total_lines\": 88,\n  \"line_range\": \"1-88\",\n  \"file_path\": \"upload/scholar_results/Cyber_Physical_Internet_Asset_Services_and_Hosts_Creation_Configuration_Execution_Lei_et_al.md\",\n  \"container_path\": \"/workspace/tasks/agent_test/upload/scholar_results/Cyber_Physical_Internet_Asset_Services_and_Hosts_Creation_Configuration_Execution_Lei_et_al.md\"\n}",
